{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-10-10T10:13:30.300Z","data":{"text":"Task complete.\n\n## Summary\n\nAdded the Vcs history reads and extra-parent support:\n\n- **`Vcs` port** (`src/core/vcs/vcs.ts`): added `mergeBase(a, b)`, `trailerValues(from, to, key)`, and optional `extraParents` on `commitTree`.\n- **`git-vcs-read.ts`** (new): extracted `root`, `head`, `indexDigest`, `stashList`, `status`, `show`, and `pathExists` bodies, taking a `GitWriteContext`; `git-vcs.ts` now delegates and is 242 lines (≤ 250).\n- **`git-vcs-land.ts`**: `commitTree` passes `-p parent` then one `-p` per extra parent, in order.\n- **`git-vcs-merge.ts`**: `mergeBase` runs one `git merge-base`, null on failure; `trailerValues` runs one `git log <from>..<to>` with a record/unit-separator format, newest first, trimmed.\n- **`no-vcs.ts`**: null/empty returns; `commitTree` accepts `extraParents`.\n- **Tests**: `tests/vcs-history-ops.test.ts` (new) proves every scenario of \"Vcs history reads\" and \"Commit with extra parents\"; `PORT_MEMBERS` updated in `vcs-write.test.ts`.\n- All three new/changed helpers carry `@scenario` and `@adr 003` tags.\n\nBoth gates pass: task verify (4/4) and proposal verify (`pnpm verify` — typechecks, build, all tests, lint). Result written to `openspec/changes/165-stacked-land-keeps-history/.run/results/1.md`."}}
